# Spec-Driven Development

- Every feature has `specs/features/NNN-kebab-name.spec.md` before implementation.
- Copy from `specs/templates/feature.spec.md`.
- Required sections: Summary, User journey, Acceptance criteria (checkboxes).
- Include Tauri commands table and Hostinger API table when applicable.
- "Out of scope" must list deferred work — open follow-up specs instead of scope creep.
- Update spec in the same PR if behavior changes during implementation.
- PR description must include: `Spec: specs/features/NNN-name.spec.md`.
